      "content": "Wait, if we pause now we're going to miss the volatility in the next hour and take a massive hit on our daily PnL. The desk is already on edge. Are you absolutely certain these were \"unconfirmed orders\" and not just high-frequency latency fluctuations? If this was just a momentary sync issue and not a logic break, a full recalibration would be a huge mistake. Re-verify the logic logs specifically—did the algorithm actually deviate from its programmed parameters during those spikes?",
